        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "This paper comprehensively reviews the microstructural characteristics, micro-cracking mechanisms, and various other methods for inhibiting crack formation in selective laser melting (SLM) manufactured nickel-based superalloys, emphasizing the need for a deeper understanding of microstructural influences on their micro-crack formation.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "71d5d38ac2fec4c9:part:001"
        },
        {
          "page": "23",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "A comprehensive understanding of microstructural features, micro-cracking mechanisms, and effective suppression strategies is essential for advancing the application of nickel-based superalloys in high-end industries such as aerospace.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "71d5d38ac2fec4c9:part:002"
        },
        {
          "page": "26",
          "section": null,
          "quote": "This integration of crack sensitivity calculations, first-principles computations, and machine learning provides new avenues for designing novel nickel-based alloys with reduced cracking susceptibility.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "71d5d38ac2fec4c9:part:002"
        }
      ]
